# 默认：文本文件在仓库中以 LF 存储，检出时也使用 LF（不受 core.autocrlf 影响）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本与解决方案文件使用 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf

# 协议测试向量与界面文案表：按字节原样存取，不做任何换行转换
# （-text 关闭换行处理，但仍按文本显示 diff）
protocol/test-vectors/** -text
*.tsv -text

# 二进制文件
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.pdf binary
